+  **So it is one observation per FIT.**
+
+With `refit_sessions = 5`:
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| sessions for 252 fits | `500 + 5 x 251` = **1,755** |
+| all-member sessions available | 552 |
+| shortfall | **1,203** (~4.8 years) |
